 nd testing\; comments in the project: what each method does\, receives and 
 gives back\n    https://itcoder.co.za/lesson.php?c=java&id=patieb\n- Java 1
 6 (part): Arrays - remembering a whole list\n    focus: two-dimensional arr
 ays: rows\, columns and their totals\n    https://itcoder.co.za/lesson.php?
 c=java&id=lesson16\n\nTheory:\n- What makes a computer fast\n    https://it
 coder.co.za/lesson.php?c=theory12&id=performance\n\nDatabases:\n- SQL 3: Ke
 ys and relationships\n    focus: keys: primary\, foreign\, composite\; rela
 tionships one-to-one\, one-to-many\, many-to-many\; referential integrity\n
