SUMMARY:IT Gr 12 T1 W3: Java 21 Managing a list - the array manager class |
  Cloud computing
DESCRIPTION:IEB Grade 12 - Java - Access - Other three-term independent sch
 ool (ISASA guideline) - T1 W3\n\nProgramming:\n- Java 18 (part): Persistenc
 e - Text files (continued)\n    https://itcoder.co.za/lesson.php?c=java&id=
 lesson18\n- Java 21 (part): Managing a list - the array manager class\n    
 focus: an array as a field of an object\, an object as a field\, and an obj
 ect whose fields are arrays of two different object types\; fields of compl
 ex type\, passing and returning complex types\, null objects and null field
 s\, and comparing data structures\; sending and giving back arrays and arra
 ys of objects\n    https://itcoder.co.za/lesson.php?c=java&id=lesson21\n\nT
 heory:\n- Cloud computing\n    https://itcoder.co.za/lesson.php?c=theory12&
 id=cloudcomputing\n- Artificial intelligence\n    https://itcoder.co.za/les
 son.php?c=theory12&id=ai12\n\nDatabases:\n- SQL 7: Big data\n    focus: dat
 a warehousing and data mining - description\, purpose\, uses\; big data sou
 rces (social media\, activity-generated data\, logs and audit trails\, loca
 tion data)\; NoSQL - description\, an example (MongoDB)\, comparison with S
 QL\n    https://itcoder.co.za/lesson.php?c=sql&id=dbbig\n- SQL 16: Joining 
 tables\n    focus: multi-table SQL: INNER JOIN and WHERE on matching keys\;
  keys: primary and foreign\; relationships between tables\n    https://itco
 der.co.za/lesson.php?c=sql&id=access08
